{"availability":"available","full":"altink02/ai-call-agent","name":"ai-call-agent","description":"Portfolio case study for AI Call Agent — a self-hosted, multi-tenant, multilingual AI phone-agent platform where compliance is enforced outside the model. Live demo page included.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-03T18:05:49Z","updated":"2026-10-13T19:03:18Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ulasmango-cmd.github.io/ai-call-agent/","topics":["ai-agents","albanian","call-center","compliance","fastapi","gdpr","german","llm","multi-tenant","multilingual","nextjs","portfolio","self-hosted","voice-ai"],"demo":"https://altink02.github.io/ai-call-agent/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.853Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.853Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.853Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:01:53.879Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.853Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Altin Kalludra · All projects · Download CV (PDF)","Every number here was produced by running code, not by reading it. This is the section a reviewer should attack.","This section exists because the alternative — a capability list with no gaps in it — would be a lie."],"features":["176 of 215 tools are declared stubs. The registry, permission gating and argument validation are done and tested; the bodies are not.","Telephony is API-only. Trunks, numbers, routing rules and dial-plan preview are modelled. The SIP gateway config has never been started. There is no SIPp suite.","The pgvector/HNSW retrieval path is written but never benchmarked — no Postgres on the development machine.","ToolInvocation is never persisted. Tool calls inside a conversation leave no durable trace.","AgentSession.summary() is never called, so the record that AI-disclosure text played is not stored — even though it does play."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/altink02/ai-call-agent/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"93b35d30334ec01e8ed4bc9d242b127c952c3dcb83a8c26499c91fec22123ac8","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.938Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.938Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Altin Kalludra · All projects · Download CV (PDF)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/altink02/ai-call-agent/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The harness starts the API on a throwaway database, seeds realistic content through the public HTTP API, then signs in through the actual login form with a real browser before capturing.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/altink02/ai-call-agent/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"If a page had rendered an error screen or redirected to sign-in, the harness would have failed rather than shipped the image.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/altink02/ai-call-agent/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"93b35d30334ec01e8ed4bc9d242b127c952c3dcb83a8c26499c91fec22123ac8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/altink02/ai-call-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.938Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-13T19:03:18Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/altink02/ai-call-agent/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.939Z","hash":"93b35d30334ec01e8ed4bc9d242b127c952c3dcb83a8c26499c91fec22123ac8","originalBytes":14980,"storedBytes":14980,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:48:56.853Z","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Portfolios & personal sites","Self-hosted apps"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["MCP servers & agents","Portfolios & personal sites","Self-hosted apps"],"evidence":[{"subject":"MCP servers & agents","source":"metadata","match":"agent"},{"subject":"Portfolios & personal sites","source":"metadata","ma